# Codex driver for the agent-teammates scripts. The contract (the declarations below, the operations and their exit
# codes) is in ../CONTRACT.md; this file holds only the Codex values. Codex teammates are turn-based
# (docs/adr/0003-codex-teammates-are-turn-based.md): `launch` and `send` start `codex exec` / `codex exec resume` in the
# background in their own process group and return once the turn has started; a finished turn reads as `done` in `status`.
# Each session keeps <team-dir>/codex-<thread-id>.state (name, process group, model, effort, role flag, workdir) and its
# `--json` event log. Read-only roles run under the `turn` wrapper, which touches reports/<name>.done after a completed
# turn that left a non-empty report; writers write their own marker. No advisor-probe: Codex has no advisor.
LIVE_MESSAGING=0
SEND=script
